---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const photoRow2 = [
  { label: "Photo 04 — portrait", src: "/images/photography/photo-04-kumrat.jpg" },
  { label: "Photo 05 — offset frame", offset: true, src: "/images/photography/photo-05-kumrat.jpg" },
  { label: "Photo 06", src: "/images/photography/photo-06-astro.jpg" },
];
---

<Layout title="About — Hammad Habib" description="Software engineer with deep frontend experience. Linux, systems, photography, and why things break.">
  <div class="min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-ink">
    <Header active="about" />

    <section id="top" class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 pt-12 pb-10 sm:px-8 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-14 lg:px-16 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-18">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-[14px] font-mono text-[11.5px] tracking-[.14em] text-[#8c8a84] uppercase">
        <span class="block h-px w-[26px] bg-[#3a3a36]"></span>
        <span>About</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="mt-[26px] max-w-[24ch] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,58px)] leading-[1.08] font-medium tracking-[-.035em] text-wrap-pretty">
        I like computers more than is strictly reasonable.
      </h1>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] flex-wrap items-start gap-8 px-5 pb-14 sm:px-8 sm:pb-20 lg:px-16 lg:gap-[72px] lg:pb-26">
      <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[460px] flex-col gap-5 lg:flex-[2]">
        <p class="m-0 max-w-[50ch] text-[clamp(16.5px,1.5vw,21px)] leading-[1.6] tracking-[-.015em] text-[#dedbd4] text-wrap-pretty">
          Linux, systems, why things are slow, why things break. Most of what I know started with breaking something first and then needing it to work again.
        </p>
        <p class="m-0 max-w-[56ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-[#a7a59e]">
          I work as a software engineer with deep frontend experience, but the parts I enjoy most sit at the edges — the server that's misconfigured, the query that's doing too much, the interaction that feels wrong and nobody can say why. Following a problem across those boundaries is the whole job to me.
        </p>
        <p class="m-0 max-w-[56ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-[#a7a59e]">
          I experiment constantly. Small tools, throwaway scripts, things that only ever run on my own machine. Some of it turns into work I can point at. Most of it just teaches me how something behaves when you push on it.
        </p>
        <p class="m-0 max-w-[56ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-[#a7a59e]">
          I also care a lot about how things look and feel. I shoot photography, I pay attention to typography and layout, and that carries directly into the interfaces I build. Design isn't a separate discipline I borrow from — it's part of how I judge whether something is finished.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[280px] flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="relative aspect-4/5 overflow-hidden border border-[#1e1e1c] bg-[#050505]">
          <video
            src="/videos/smoker.mp4"
            poster="/videos/posters/smoker.jpg"
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="metadata"
            class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-90"
            style="animation: hh-drift 24s ease-in-out infinite"
          ></video>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(10,10,10,.3),rgba(10,10,10,.05)_45%,rgba(10,10,10,.6))]"></div>
          <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[.12em] text-[#cfcdc6] uppercase">Video / sketch loop</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[.1em] text-[#6e6c67] uppercase">Hand-drawn loop — the same one used on the homepage</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] border-t border-[#1e1e1c] px-5 py-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-16 lg:py-16">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start gap-6 lg:gap-12">
        <span class="flex-none pt-1 font-mono text-[11.5px] tracking-[.14em] text-paper uppercase">Currently</span>
        <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[420px] flex-col gap-[14px]">
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="mt-[-2px] block h-[6px] w-[6px] flex-none rounded-full bg-accent" style="animation: hh-blink 2.4s infinite"></span>
            <span class="text-[clamp(15.5px,1.3vw,18px)] leading-[1.55] text-[#dedbd4]">Building client and product work at SolvoLab — migrations, performance, servers.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
            <span class="mt-[-2px] block h-[6px] w-[6px] flex-none rounded-full bg-[#3a3a36]"></span>
            <span class="text-[clamp(15.5px,1.3vw,18px)] leading-[1.55] text-[#a7a59e]">Learning more about networking and infrastructure than a frontend engineer needs to.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-[#1e1e1c] bg-[#070707] py-14 sm:py-20 lg:py-26">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-16">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 font-mono text-[11.5px] tracking-[.14em] text-[#8c8a84] uppercase">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-8 gap-y-2">
            <span class="text-paper">Photography</span>
            <span>My own photographs · not decoration</span>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/pics"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 border border-[#353531] px-4 py-3 text-paper transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:bg-accent hover:text-ink focus-visible:border-accent focus-visible:outline-none"
          >
            See more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-[22px] max-w-[48ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-[#a7a59e]">
          Shooting is how I practise looking at things properly. It's the same attention I bring to an interface: what's in frame, what got left out, where the eye lands first.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-9 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:mt-14 lg:px-16">
        <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1560px] flex-wrap items-stretch gap-[14px]">
          <div class="relative flex min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[440px] items-end overflow-hidden border border-[#1e1e1c] p-[18px] aspect-3/2 lg:flex-[2]">
            <img src="/images/photography/photo-01-wheat.jpg" alt="Wheat field at golden hour" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" />
          </div>
          <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[220px] flex-col gap-[14px]">
            <div class="relative flex min-h-[130px] flex-1 items-end overflow-hidden border border-[#1e1e1c] p-4">
              <img src="/images/photography/photo-02-sahmani.jpg" alt="Mountain valley overlook" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" />
            </div>
            <div class="relative flex min-h-[130px] flex-1 items-end overflow-hidden border border-[#1e1e1c] p-4">
              <img src="/images/photography/photo-03-peacock.jpg" alt="Peacock on a porch bench" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mx-auto mt-[14px] flex max-w-[1560px] flex-wrap items-stretch gap-[14px]">
          {photoRow2.map((photo) => (
            <div
              class:list={[
                "relative flex min-w-0 flex-1 basis-[200px] items-end overflow-hidden border border-[#1e1e1c] p-4 aspect-4/5",
                photo.offset && "mt-0 lg:mt-10",
              ]}
            >
              <img src={photo.src} alt={photo.label} class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" />
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] border-t border-[#1e1e1c] px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 lg:px-16 lg:py-26">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-8">
        <h2 class="m-0 max-w-[24ch] flex-1 basis-[420px] text-[clamp(24px,3vw,42px)] leading-[1.12] font-medium tracking-[-.03em] text-wrap-pretty">
          If any of that sounds useful, the work is one page over.
        </h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-[14px]">
          <a
            href="/#work"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-[10px] rounded-[2px] bg-paper px-[22px] py-[14px] text-[14.5px] font-medium text-ink hover:bg-accent"
          >
            Explore my work →
          </a>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-[10px] rounded-[2px] border border-[#2b2b28] px-[22px] py-[14px] text-[14.5px] text-[#cfcdc6] hover:border-[#5a5a54] hover:text-paper"
          >
            Get in touch
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Footer />
  </div>
</Layout>
